msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ti chiedo per favore... ⟪k:1⟫di non lasciare la mia mano."

#: scenario6:scenario6_CA195F44_E69A_47A7_8596_4880D7E9C30E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bd0c2a884ee4bec6590acebeb122453b99ae4376bf3c5f8ca76059dc2674bde
