msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_CA195F44_E69A_47A7_8596_4880D7E9C30E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blood had seeped into the fabric, and it was beginning to dry.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When I clenched it "
"in my hand, it made soft crackling sounds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il fluido scarlatto era penetrato nel tessuto, e aveva cominciato a seccarsi.⟪k:1⟫ Quando "
"afferrai la stoffa tra le mani, questa produsse degli scricchiolii."

#: scenario6:scenario6_AA8CB7A0_0322_4DCA_AC82_4915EE82167B
