msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He spends all this time refusing to talk to me...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and when "
"he finally does, he begs me to save his love?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Trascorre tutto il tempo rifiutandosi di parlarmi...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫e "
"quando finalmente si decide a farlo,⟪k:8⟫mi supplica di salvare la sua amata?"

