"⟪k:0⟫A woman standing alone in front of a mirror practicing how to smile. ⟪k:1⟫I’m sure that was "
"quite the comical sight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Una donna sola, in piedi davanti a uno specchio, mentre si allenava a sorridere. ⟪k:1⟫Sono "
"sicura che quella fosse una vista alquanto bizzarra."

